-- Different OWN words and slack phases still attach to the same original mark.
example (c a b :List Bool) (hA :IntegralMixedRoadmapAtomic.Valid hn ht ha hR0 a)
    (hB :IntegralMixedRoadmapAtomic.Valid hn ht ha hR0 b)
